source: crates/navree-orm/tests/sql/main.rs
expression: "per_dialect(|d|\ncompile_update_from(&query.table, &sets, &query.joins, &query.wheres, d))"
---
PostgreSQL: UPDATE "deals" SET "stage" = $1 FROM "companies" AS "c" WHERE "c"."id" = "deals"."company_id" AND "c"."active" = $2
  values: [String(Some("lost")), Bool(Some(false))]
MySQL: UPDATE `deals` JOIN `companies` AS `c` ON `c`.`id` = `deals`.`company_id` AND `c`.`active` = ? SET `deals`.`stage` = ?
  values: [Bool(Some(false)), String(Some("lost"))]
SQLite: UPDATE "deals" SET "stage" = ? FROM "companies" AS "c" WHERE "c"."id" = "deals"."company_id" AND "c"."active" = ?
  values: [String(Some("lost")), Bool(Some(false))]
